sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Platform Operator
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Mgr as Manager<br/>(controller-runtime)
    participant Rec as LLMBatchGateway<br/>Reconciler
    participant Helm as Helm Chart<br/>Renderer
    participant MetCtrl as Metrics<br/>Controller
    participant CM as cert-manager
    participant GW as Gateway API
    participant Prom as prometheus-operator

    Note over User,Prom: Reconciliation Loop

    User->>K8s: Create/Update LLMBatchGateway CR
    K8s-->>Mgr: Watch event (LLMBatchGateway)
    Mgr->>Rec: Enqueue reconciliation

    Rec->>K8s: Get LLMBatchGateway CR
    K8s-->>Rec: CR spec + status

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Rec,Helm: Helm Chart Rendering
        Rec->>Helm: Render batch-gateway chart<br/>(values from CR spec)
        Helm-->>Rec: Rendered manifests
        Rec->>Helm: Render async-processor chart<br/>(if asyncConfig present)
        Helm-->>Rec: Rendered manifests (conditional)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Rec,K8s: Server-Side Apply Resources
        Rec->>K8s: Apply Deployments<br/>(API server, processor, GC, async-processor)
        Rec->>K8s: Apply Services, ConfigMaps, ServiceAccounts
        Rec->>K8s: Prune orphaned resources<br/>(via managedGVKs)
    end

    opt cert-manager CRD detected
        Rec->>K8s: Apply cert-manager Certificates
        K8s->>CM: Certificate CR reconciled
    end

    opt Gateway API CRD detected
        Rec->>K8s: Apply HTTPRoutes
        K8s->>GW: HTTPRoute reconciled
    end

    opt prometheus-operator CRD detected
        Rec->>K8s: Apply ServiceMonitors,<br/>PodMonitors, PrometheusRules
        K8s->>Prom: Monitoring resources reconciled
    end

    Rec->>K8s: Update LLMBatchGateway status<br/>(per-component conditions)
    K8s-->>User: Status reflects component readiness

    Note over User,Prom: Cross-Namespace Secret Sync

    User->>K8s: Create LLMBatchGateway<br/>(references Secret in other namespace)
    K8s-->>Rec: Watch event
    Rec->>K8s: Get ReferenceGrant<br/>(source namespace)
    K8s-->>Rec: ReferenceGrant exists ✓
    Rec->>K8s: Read source Secret
    K8s-->>Rec: Secret data
    Rec->>K8s: Create managed Secret copy<br/>(gateway namespace)
    Note right of Rec: Reference is immutable<br/>once established

    Note over MetCtrl,Prom: Metrics Service Lifecycle

    Mgr->>MetCtrl: Bootstrap on startup
    MetCtrl->>K8s: Apply metrics Service<br/>(ClusterIP 8443/TCP)
    MetCtrl->>K8s: Apply ServiceMonitor
    MetCtrl->>K8s: Apply PrometheusRule<br/>(alerting rules)
    K8s->>Prom: Scrape target registered
